        }
      ],
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"I don't think he has any intention of letting you know when he plans on visiting you,\" he says",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5172
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "If he's willing to fly across the country to come here with the intent of raping me—or worse—he can die",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5845
        },
        {
          "text": "Just the idea of that gets rid of any doubt I might have had before. This man is dangerous, and I want him gone",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5666
        }
      ],
      "words": 45
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"That's not my only mode of operating.\"",
          "ok": true,
